**Prophetic Hag** | Unaligned Power | Limited
__Basics__
The Prophetic Hag must live win with a solo team. During the night, the Hag may choose to investigate a player.
__Details__
The Prophetic Hag wins if they survive until the end of the game and if a solo team wins the game.
If a Solo player uses a power on the Prophetic Hag, the Prophetic Hag learns their identity. If they attempt to kill the Prophetic Hag, the attack fails.
During the night, the Prophetic Hag may choose to investigate a player. The Prophetic Hag's investigation is not affected by redirections or disguises.
Investigating a player is an immediate ability.
If the last solo role dies, the Hag turns into a solo role, becoming a bitter hag.

